# Displacer Kitten: if its target is gone when the trigger resolves, the trigger does nothing (CR 608.2b) and the card
# is not returned. On turn 3 Bot1 casts Mox Emerald and the trigger targets Thraben Inspector; in response Bot2 kills the
# Inspector with a Lightning Bolt (paid with its Mox Ruby). The Inspector stays in the graveyard and there is no second
# Clue. The positive control is the neighbouring scenario, where the same trigger returns it.

